# Keep local state and build output outside the build context.
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.ai-team
**/.codex
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/node_modules
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.log
# Local configuration and credentials never enter an image layer.
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.Production.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/.secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/.aspnet
# Each Dockerfile copies its own project graph; tests are not runtime inputs.
src/tests

